  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project India Netherlands CoE on Water</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ambition of this assignment is to demonstrate the technical, operational and economic feasibility of producing high-quality reusable water from polluted urban drain water through the deployment of innovative treatment technologies. The demonstration shall provide evidence for future large-scale implementation and support decision-making by NMCG, the Centre of Excellence and other relevant stakeholders regarding urban water reuse strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
